Subject: power: supply: PM7250B charger, BQ27411 gauge

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - power: supply: Add Qualcomm PM7250B charger status and charge inhibit driver
  - power: supply: qcom_pm7250b_charger: add charge control start/end thresholds

---
